"folder later. Photos are only ever added: one removed from the folder stays "
"in the gallery, and one you delete from the gallery is not brought back. "
"Galleries that existed before you turn this on only get photos added to "
"their folder after that. Each check of a cloud folder reads the list of "
"files in your bucket, so checking every hour means more requests to your "
"storage service."

