"Order count and revenue across a date range, optionally grouped by day/week/"
"month. Revenue is NET — order-level refunds are subtracted. Only paid "
"statuses are included by default (override via `status`). The response also "
"breaks out `gross_revenue`, `refunds`, `tax`, and `shipping`."
msgstr "Order count and revenue across a date range, optionally grouped by day/week/month. Revenue is NET — order-level refunds are subtracted. Only paid statuses are included by default (override via `status`). The response also breaks out `gross_revenue`, `refunds`, `tax`, and `shipping`."

